.fi
.RE
.PP
Changes the delivery time ID with the JSON Patch (RFC 6902) in \fB\-\-file\fR: an array of operations whose op is add, remove or replace, such as \fB[{"op": "replace", "path": "/name", "value": "Mondays"}]\fR. An unknown ID is not found (exit 4).
.PP
