.PP
.RS "4"
.nf
epx delivery\-times slots delete DELIVERY_TIME_ID ID [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Deletes the time slot ID of a delivery time. DELIVERY_TIME_ID is the ID that \fBepx delivery\-times list\fR shows; an unknown one is not found. ID is the ID that \fBepx delivery\-times slots list DELIVERY_TIME_ID\fR shows; an unknown one is answered as one that Emporix deleted (204 No Content).
.PP
Deletes data, which cannot be undone. On a terminal, epx sends DELETE only once you type ID at its prompt. \fB\-\-yes\fR sends without asking (required without a terminal); \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR prints the request instead of sending it.
