epx delivery\-times slots delete\-all DELIVERY_TIME_ID [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Deletes every time slot of a delivery time. DELIVERY_TIME_ID is the ID that \fBepx delivery\-times list\fR shows; an unknown one is not found.
