.nf
epx delivery\-times slots get DELIVERY_TIME_ID ID [flags]
.fi
.RE
.PP
Reads one time slot of a delivery time. DELIVERY_TIME_ID is the ID that \fBepx delivery\-times list\fR shows; an unknown one is not found. ID is the ID that \fBepx delivery\-times slots list DELIVERY_TIME_ID\fR shows; an unknown one is not found. METHOD is the shipping method of the slot (\fBepx shipping zones methods list\fR), FROM and TO its delivery window in the delivery time\(aqs TIME ZONE, CUT\-OFF the latest time of day to order for the slot (sent as an ISO 8601 timestamp whose date Emporix ignores), CUT\-OFF DAYS how many days the delivery follows such an order (weekday delivery times only; otherwise see DAY SHIFT in \fBepx delivery\-times list\fR), and CAPACITY how many orders the slot takes.
